description:
Design a circuit that determines if the difference between two gravity inputs exceeds a specified threshold. If `gravity0` is greater than `gravity1`, the module outputs a HIGH signal (`fall` = 1) only when the difference between `gravity0` and `gravity1` is greater than 700; otherwise, the output is LOW. This functionality can be likened to a conditional comparator with a threshold.
module top_module(
input [31:0]gravity0,
input [31:0]gravity1,
output fall
    );

code:
module top_module(
input [31:0]gravity0,
input [31:0]gravity1,
output fall
    );parameter [31:0]value = 700;
    assign fall = (gravity0 > gravity1) ? (((gravity0 - gravity1) > value) ? 1'b1 : 1'b0) : 1'b0;
endmodule

